\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

μέσα-έξω
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Formula $\rightarrow$
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Formula $r\geq R$
\end_inset

 και 
\begin_inset Formula $r<R$
\end_inset

 στην ακτινική διεύθηνση.
