\[
φ_{out}=\int_{r}^{\infty}\left\Vert \vec{E}_{out}\right\Vert \hat{r}_{0}\cdot dr\hat{r}_{0}=\frac{Q}{4\piε}\int_{r}^{\infty}\frac{1}{r^{2}}dr=\frac{Q}{4\piε}\left[-\frac{1}{r}\right]_{r}^{\infty}\Rightarrowφ_{out}=\frac{Q}{4\piεr}\quad\left[V\right],\;r\geq R
