φ_{in}=\int_{r}^{\infty}\left\Vert \vec{E}\right\Vert \hat{r}_{0}\cdot dr\hat{r}_{0}=\int_{r}^{R}\left\Vert \vec{E_{in}}\right\Vert \cdot dr+\int_{R}^{\infty}\left\Vert \vec{E}_{out}\right\Vert \cdot dr=\int_{r}^{R}0\cdot dr+\int_{R}^{\infty}\left\Vert \vec{E}_{out}\right\Vert \cdot dr
